    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="23.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 23.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ gecyðe seo gewitnysse þæt on Godes helde ⁊ on his hlafordes, þæt heo him on soðre gewitnysse si, swa heo hít eagum ofersæh ⁊ earum oferhyrdon, þæt he hit mid rihte begeate.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And the witnesses, as they wish to obtain the favour of God and of their lord, shall declare that, in bearing testimony on his behalf to the effect that he acquired it legally, they are speaking the truth, in accordance with what they saw with their eyes and heard with their ears.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">⁊ gecyðe seo gewitnes þæt on Godes helde ⁊ on hlafordes, þæt heo him on soðre gewitnesse sy, swa heo hit eagum oferseah ⁊ earum oferhyrde, þæt he hit mid rihte begeate.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
